      "content": "That's a good start for the tone. To make the debate more intense for the students, can you expand on that speech? Specifically, I want the administrator to get more detailed about why they believe the local populations are incapable of self-governance. Have him explain the inherent differences in character or intellect that necessitate this \"guidance\" from the British. It needs to feel authentic to that specific 19th-century worldview.",
