      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "\"Frankly, the evidence of self-governance in these territories is utterly lacking; they possess a tribalistic nature ill-suited to the complexities of modern administration. Their customs, while colorful, often descend into indolence and superstition when faced with reason and systematic industry. We observe a profound inability to grasp abstract political theory or the demands of modern commerce, rendering them perpetually childlike in their decision-making. Therefore, our firm guidance is not an imposition, but a demonstrable necessity to shepherd them toward the rational order that benefits all mankind.\"",
